        "## 4. Comparing and Plotting Results"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "a7e0fe51",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "This module contains a plotting function titled `varyped.plot_varyped_results` that accepts the *results* array returned by an equilibrium scan and plots the pressure, pressure derivative, and current profiles that are produced. A brief run summary can also be returned using `varyped.summarize_scan`. The only parameter these functions use for input is:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `results`: Varyped quick results array from running an equilibrium scan. The first entry in the array contains the scaling values used for the run, the input gfile object, and the input pfile object.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
